OL,3,GNEWSADeaf couple watch 'emotional' DIY
OL,4,ASOS rebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deaf couple whose home was rebuilt by
OL,7,Fhundreds of volunteers have described
OL,8,Fthe "emotional" moment they watched the
OL,9,Ftransformation on TV with the people
OL,10,Fwho made it happen.
OL,12,FAhmed and Rifat Ali, from Bitterne in
OL,13,FSouthampton, joined tradespeople,
OL,14,Fvolunteers and neighbours at a
OL,15,Fscreening of BBC One's DIY SOS: The Big
OL,16,FBuild on Tuesday.
OL,18,FThe family lost #72,000 - their life
OL,19,Fsavings - on an unsafe ground floor
OL,20,Fextension that was halted and later
OL,21,Fcondemned.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
